WEBVTT

00:24.925 --> 00:31.490
The stage is empty The crowd is gone Another

00:31.550 --> 00:33.591
night, another dawn

00:36.854 --> 00:44.219
We played the part We sang the song And now we have

00:44.279 --> 00:46.381
to move along The

00:49.383 --> 00:51.765
neon heart is turning low

00:55.225 --> 00:57.866
It's just a faded distant glow

01:01.308 --> 01:05.811
Is this the dream we wanted so? I guess we'll

01:05.871 --> 01:15.476
never know We're just echoes in the city It's not

01:15.576 --> 01:24.521
so bad, it's not so pretty Just echoes turning to

01:24.581 --> 01:31.638
grey We'll come back and find another day. A

01:48.810 --> 01:51.172
very soft malachite thirsty,

01:56.263 --> 01:57.383
Another day

02:02.306 --> 02:03.246
Another way

02:14.452 --> 02:20.815
Just echoes turning to grey We'll come back and

02:20.895 --> 02:23.476
fight Another day

02:32.571 --> 02:36.380
after the show good night

